    "Question #: 2": {
      "Title": "Exam DES-1B31 topic 1 question 2 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "An organization is planning to integrate many S3 client applications with ECS. The applications are using virtual host style addressing for bucket identification."
